#asm_infix_shape :
	`|` :
		form : `short_circuit`
	`&` :
		form : `short_circuit`
	`,` :
		form : `build`
	` ` :
		form : `apply_or_build`
	`~` :
		form : `range_triple`
	`~+` :
		form : `range_triple`
	`'` :
		form : `index_guard`

`--- infix の命令（signed） ---`

#asm_infix_signed :
	`==` :
		form : `cond`
		gpr_signed : `eq`
		gpr_unsigned : `eq`
	`!==` :
		form : `cond`
		gpr_signed : `ne`
		gpr_unsigned : `ne`
	`<` :
		form : `cond`
		gpr_signed : `lt`
		gpr_unsigned : `lo`
	`<=` :
		form : `cond`
		gpr_signed : `le`
		gpr_unsigned : `ls`
	`=` :
		form : `cond`
		gpr_signed : `eq`
		gpr_unsigned : `eq`
	`>=` :
		form : `cond`
		gpr_signed : `ge`
		gpr_unsigned : `hs`
	`>` :
		form : `cond`
		gpr_signed : `gt`
		gpr_unsigned : `hi`
	`!=` :
		form : `cond`
		gpr_signed : `ne`
		gpr_unsigned : `ne`
	`+` :
		form : `alu`
		gpr_signed : `add`
		gpr_unsigned : `add`
	`-` :
		form : `alu`
		gpr_signed : `sub`
		gpr_unsigned : `sub`
	`*` :
		form : `alu`
		gpr_signed : `mul`
		gpr_unsigned : `mul`
	`/` :
		form : `alu`
		gpr_signed : `sdiv`
		gpr_unsigned : `udiv`

